  "description": "A road-racing elite ride that lasts a lifetime.\nAt the pinnacle of our road line, the Vamoots CRD (Complete Race Design) is built from our double-butted RSL (Race Super Light) titanium tube set for a frame that’s light, responsive, and smooth in every detail. 3D-printed dropouts add stiffness and perfect brake alignment, while slim seat stays bring the balanced comfort MOOTS riders expect.\nA fully integrated cockpit and T47 bottom bracket keep cables tucked away for a clean, functional design. With room for 32c tires, the Vamoots CRD is at home pushing the pace, holding a line, and carrying you through mile after mile of pavement.",
